Package: peakTrAMS
Type: Package
Title: This package reads LC-HRMS data, performs removal of procedural blank signal from sample signal 
    and contains functions for processing mzXML files. Moreover, it is capable of searching for common 
    and unique peaks in complimentary HILIC-HRMS and RP-HRMS chromatograms.
Version: 1.0
Date: 2015-11-09
Author: Alygizakis Nikiforos <nalygizakis@chem.uoa.gr>
Maintainer: Alygizakis Nikiforos <nalygizakis@chem.uoa.gr>
Description: Reads, processes, writes the modified mzXML files and 
             compares peak lists from HILIC-HRMS and RP-HRMS.
Depends: R (>= 3.1.0), xcms (>= 1.42.0), caTools (>= 1.17.1), XML (>= 3.98-1.3)
License: GPL (>= 2)
RoxygenNote: 7.1.0
Suggests: knitr,
    rmarkdown
VignetteBuilder: knitr
